.TH BVI 1 "2026-08-14" "bedit 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bvi \- tracked vi wrapper for the bedit revision store
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bvi
.I FILE ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bvi
opens files in
.B vi
and records tracked access, backups, diffs, and revision history in the
.B bedit
filesystem store.
.PP
.B bvi
owns file-editing only. Repo review commands belong to
.BR bedit (1).
.SH NOTES
Each tracked edit session snapshots the file before edit, launches the editor,
and if content changed stores a new revision record.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bedit (1)
